{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/Logo_Banner_Gif.gif?t=1750865638\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBARK THE &quot;MY LAST 20&quot; MISSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE COMPANY</strong> urgently seeks brave astronauts to enlist on the &quot;My Last 20&quot; mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your objective:</strong> extract as many Space Tokens as possible from the Chaos Zone and survive for a ONLY 20 seconds. <span class=\"bb_strike\">This mission posses life insurace in case of death.</span>\u00a0Are you that brave astronaut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/Arcade_Gameplay_Gif.gif?t=1750865638\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Missions</strong>: Hardcore challenge where you have to survive for 20 seconds, but won't be easy task, the Chaos Zone\u00a0will have no mercy. Move at hyper-speed to avoid being hit by asteroids, cows, tentacles and other space stuff. There are 3 different difficulties for these missions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade:</strong>\u00a0Fast pace, power-ups, 3 shields and endless time to achieve your best time and show it off to your other astronaut fellas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more modes in the future.... like having to destroy a corrupted planet?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHO ARE YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The identity of the person behind the helmet remains a mystery but one thing is certain: sanity is not a quality of you. You are the only one who enlisted willingly to this mission and survived at least twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/extras/Character_Rotating_Gif.gif?t=1750865638\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INCREDIBLY HARD</strong>: Being able to complete the My Last 20 mission is not a easy task. 20 seconds sounds like a short time but have to avoid even <strong>cows</strong> makes it challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUICK GAMEPLAY:</strong>\u00a0Perfect for those who like to test their reflexes and having to react in matter of seconds to avoid being killed by a <strong>Space Tentacle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAZY LOOKING GRAPHICS:</strong>\u00a0A combination of modern and retro pixel art graphics with unique and weird characters make a perfect combination for a real trip.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MULTIPLE CHALLENGES:</strong> Play the main missions, complete hard challenges or play endlessly without time limitations and score your best time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One Sec?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"5s....","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"5+5 = 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"15s not big deal!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"That was sooooo close!!!!!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2213990/c4a2101a443903c4b6943fc2e1a3c78a2ca16c6d.jpg"},{"name":"Extractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/