strong> makes it challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUICK GAMEPLAY:</strong>\u00a0Perfect for those who like to test their reflexes and having to react in matter of seconds to avoid being killed by a <strong>Space Tentacle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAZY LOOKING GRAPHICS:</strong>\u00a0A combination of modern and retro pixel art graphics with unique and weird characters make a perfect combination for a real trip.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MULTIPLE CHALLENGES:</strong> Play the main missions, complete hard challenges or play endlessly without time limitations and score your best time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["DroidGames Studio"],"dlc":[3744330],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213990/47a95fc5b926b134e83d6b97dc4a075441cf5548/header.jpg?t=1750865638","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155578,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155578/movie480.mp4?t=1749656780","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155578/movie_max.mp4?t=1749656780"},"name":"My Last 20 - Demo Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155578/661bfef499c3675c172a6c79dc6c60e1f238d1a4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749656780","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155578/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749656780","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25715